{"id":"2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features","date":"2026-10-23","topic":"design","region":"americas","headline":"Mexican university building features Gothic architecture design","source":{"name":"Dezeen","url":"https://www.dezeen.com/2026/10/22/jonathan-corral-arquitectos-uad-alamedas-durango/"},"accent":"us","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"A new school building opens in Mexico now.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","M","M","M"],"dur":3.29,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":3.85,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.38,0.72,1.2,1.74,2.1,2.56]},{"text":"The design uses ideas from old church windows.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.4,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":4.13,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.36,0.78,1.32,1.8,2.14,2.48]},{"text":"The tall tower has eight levels and rooms.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":2.81,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":3.66,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.3,0.76,1.16,1.44,1.82,2.12]},{"text":"Students study law and art inside here today.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":3.5,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":5.17,"times":[0.0,0.34,0.68,1.12,1.52,1.82,2.28,2.62]}],"bands":{"core1000":91,"core1800":3,"ngsl":3,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"A new school building","title":"Subject-Verb Agreement with Singular Nouns","note":"When the subject is singular (like 'building'), the present tense verb needs an 's' at the end. Here, 'building opens' shows this basic rule in action."},{"i":3,"focus":"inside here today","title":"Using Multiple Adverbs of Place and Time","note":"You can put more than one modifier at the end of a sentence. Place comes first ('inside here'), and time comes last ('today')."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"A Mexican design studio finished a new university building.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t2-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.22,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":5.14,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.62,0.96,1.64,2.16,2.46,2.72,3.32]},{"text":"The tall tower looks like old European church windows.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.79,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":4.63,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.36,0.9,1.24,1.52,1.88,2.48,2.9]},{"text":"Students will study many subjects inside the eight levels.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.6,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":5.2,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.56,0.84,1.2,1.76,2.32,2.66,2.88]},{"text":"The front has glass panels and a metal screen.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.18,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":4.26,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.38,0.72,1.04,1.6,2.02,2.12,2.38]},{"text":"Visitors can enjoy views from the top area.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.08,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":4.94,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.64,0.92,1.3,1.74,1.86,2.06]}],"bands":{"core1000":81,"core1800":10,"ngsl":7,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":2},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"will study","title":"Expressing Future Actions with Will","note":"Use 'will' before a base verb to talk about future plans or actions. In this sentence, 'will study' tells us what students are going to do later."},{"i":4,"focus":"can enjoy","title":"Showing Ability with Modal Can","note":"The modal verb 'can' is placed before the main verb to show possibility or ability. Here, 'can enjoy' means visitors can look at the views if they go there."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"Jonathan Corral Arquitectos has completed a striking educational tower in Mexico.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t3-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":6.03,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":6.49,"times":[0.0,0.48,1.12,2.0,2.46,2.88,3.22,3.62,4.1,5.02,5.32]},{"text":"The new structure features a shaped outer wall inspired by old church windows.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.11,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":7.08,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.24,0.62,1.14,1.44,1.78,2.08,2.54,3.1,3.64,3.94,4.26]},{"text":"This building stands near a famous tree-lined public path in the city.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.06,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":5.75,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.4,0.76,1.12,1.34,1.81,2.54,2.86,3.26,3.54,3.64]},{"text":"Inside the eight levels, students find study rooms, meeting spaces, and food areas.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t3-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.31,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":6.12,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.5,0.74,1.44,1.8,2.08,2.42,3.24,3.44,4.26,4.38,4.6]},{"text":"The front side combines grey panels with dark metal screens.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.69,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":5.59,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.3,0.62,1.0,1.46,1.88,2.3,2.56,2.9]},{"text":"A top outdoor area offers visitors wonderful views of the surrounding urban landscape.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.49,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":6.59,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.3,0.6,1.16,1.6,1.98,2.44,2.92,3.22,3.34,3.74,4.2]}],"bands":{"core1000":75,"core1800":9,"ngsl":11,"tsl":1,"nawl":1,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"has completed","title":"Present Perfect for Recent Completion","note":"Use 'has' plus a past participle to show an action that is recently finished and important now. 'Has completed' tells us the building is newly done."},{"i":5,"focus":"offers visitors wonderful views","title":"Double Objects: Indirect and Direct","note":"Some verbs like 'offer' can take two objects without a preposition. 'Visitors' is the indirect object (who receives), and 'wonderful views' is the direct object."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"Mexican studio Jonathan Corral Arquitectos has completed the new UAD Alamedas Tower.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t4-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.9,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":8.61,"times":[0.0,0.46,1.02,1.62,2.28,3.16,3.58,3.96,4.26,4.5,5.32,6.32]},{"text":"The building features a unique outer wall that draws inspiration from historical stained glass.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","S","V","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.72,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":6.77,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.32,0.74,1.04,1.4,1.78,2.22,2.68,2.86,3.4,3.82,4.3,4.86]},{"text":"Spanning eight levels, the triangular structure houses study rooms, offices, and large halls.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t4-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.09,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":7.41,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.66,1.46,1.54,1.86,2.36,2.84,3.24,3.96,4.94,5.08,5.26]},{"text":"The exterior combines grey panels, black metal screens, and clear glass windows.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t4-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.25,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":6.82,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.54,1.04,1.5,2.42,2.64,2.9,3.76,3.84,4.1,4.42]},{"text":"Inside the main entrance, visitors discover a central hall with special glass railings.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t4-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.25,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":6.12,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.5,0.64,1.54,1.84,2.32,2.64,2.9,3.42,3.74,4.08,4.44]},{"text":"Exposed concrete walls and wooden ceilings highlight the interior construction methods.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t4-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.1,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":5.8,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.76,1.28,1.66,1.88,2.34,2.96,3.26,3.74,4.1]},{"text":"A top outdoor space provides a gathering area with views across the city.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t4-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.65,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":5.5,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.32,0.62,1.2,1.58,1.78,2.06,2.54,2.96,3.2,3.62,3.88]}],"bands":{"core1000":61,"core1800":16,"ngsl":12,"tsl":4,"nawl":2,"beyond":5},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"that draws","title":"Defining Relative Clauses with That","note":"The word 'that' introduces a relative clause that describes 'a unique outer wall'. It acts as the subject of the mini-clause 'draws inspiration'."},{"i":2,"focus":"Spanning eight levels,","title":"Participial Phrases as Introductory Modifiers","note":"Starting a sentence with an '-ing' verb phrase is a great way to describe an action happening at the same time. 'Spanning eight levels' describes the structure."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Mexican design practice Jonathan Corral Arquitectos has completed the striking UAD Alamedas Tower.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t5-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.96,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":9.54,"times":[0.0,0.52,0.88,1.52,2.18,2.86,3.74,4.3,4.78,5.06,5.48,6.56,7.42]},{"text":"Positioned beside a prominent urban public path, the triangular building features a carefully shaped glass outer wall.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t5-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.38,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":8.33,"times":[0.0,0.46,0.58,0.58,1.32,1.7,2.12,3.1,3.24,3.52,4.22,4.68,4.92,5.36,5.86,6.32,6.74]},{"text":"The exterior design translates the compositional logic of historical stained-glass windows into a contemporary scale.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t5-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.95,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":6.76,"times":[0.0,0.42,0.72,1.44,2.06,2.4,3.14,3.56,3.84,4.46,5.24,5.64,6.42,6.6,6.98]},{"text":"Spanning eight levels and a basement, the facility accommodates diverse spaces including study rooms and large halls.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t5-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.24,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":7.63,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.66,1.0,1.3,1.38,2.2,2.36,2.68,3.48,3.7,4.4,5.18,5.56,5.92,6.24,6.44]},{"text":"Along the main side, grey panels contrast with dark metal screens and transparent glass.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t5-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.73,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":7.04,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.36,0.54,1.22,1.5,1.92,2.52,2.92,3.2,3.52,4.02,4.42,4.86]},{"text":"Upon entering, visitors encounter a full-height central hall framed by walkways with special glass railings.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t5-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.79,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":7.27,"times":[0.0,0.52,1.3,1.66,2.1,2.24,3.06,3.46,3.9,4.22,4.54,5.08,5.36,5.68,6.0]},{"text":"Exposed concrete and wooden ceilings throughout the interior celebrate the underlyi